havior.\n- Remove stale shell-history narration where it obscures current compact behavior.\n- Compare each documentation statement with its named code path or public signature.\n- Change no public behavior.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] docs/exit-codes.md documents exit 11 for a retryable LLMError raised during completion verification.\n- [ ] docs/exit-codes.md documents exit 11 when bounded completion recovery returns verdict_obtainable=false.\n- [ ] Ordinary completion failure and nonretryable indeterminate outcomes remain distinct.\n- [ ] Public docstrings in src/rebar/_lib_mutations.py cover each named mutation wrapper.\n- [ ] docs/reuse-surface.md covers each named mutation wrapper.\n- [ ] Reviewer inspection confirms that the documentation matches the named code paths and signatures.\n- [ ] The commands in Verification pass.\n- [ ] No public behavior changes.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" pytest tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py tests/interfaces/facades/test_leaf_writes_parity.py`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make lint`\n- `env PATH=\"$PWD/.venv/bin:$PATH\" make typecheck`\n- Review docs/exit-codes.md against `src/rebar/_cli/_llm_commands.py::_verify_completion` and `src/rebar/_commands/close_precheck.py::_completion_precheck`.\n- Review docs/reuse-surface.md and each public docstring against the corresponding signature in src/rebar/_lib_mutations.py.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[{"path":"docs/exit-codes.md","reason":"Document both completion exit 11 paths."},{"path":"docs/reuse-surface.md","reason":"Document five public mutation functions."},{"path":"src/rebar/_lib_mutations.py","reason":"Add accurate public docstrings and remove stale implementation history."}],"file_impact_scope":"paths","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["parent","2bce-d81d-0eed-42e5"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"2bce-d81d-0eed-42e5","parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","pre